---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Contact Us — AI Betting Tips"
  description="Get in touch with AI Betting Tips about feedback, corrections, data requests or partnerships."
  active="">

  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Contact</div>
      <h1>Contact <em>us</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">We read every message. For the fastest reply, tell us which page you mean and what you'd like us to do.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>The best way to reach us is by email: <a href="mailto:contact@ai-betting-tips.com">contact@ai-betting-tips.com</a>. We aim to reply within a few working days.</p>

      <h2>What we can help with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Feedback &amp; corrections</strong> — spotted an error in a prediction, stat or review? Let us know and we'll fix it.</li>
        <li><strong>Data requests</strong> — to access or delete any personal data, see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Partnerships</strong> — operators and affiliate managers can pitch a listing. Note that a commercial deal never changes our editorial scores.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Individual betting advice</strong> — we publish general tips only and can't advise on specific wagers.</li>
        <li><strong>Operator account issues</strong> — for deposits, withdrawals, bonuses or verification, contact that bookmaker or casino's own support team; we have no access to your accounts.</li>
        <li><strong>Gambling support</strong> — if betting stops being fun, please see our <a href="/responsible-gambling">Responsible Gambling</a> page for free, confidential help.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr />
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
